<Base title="Personal technology support in Arizona | HourlyTechs" description="Get help with everyday technology, from a slow laptop to confusing email settings. Our planned service is designed for Arizona households, with a real person guiding you through the problem."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Arizona / Personal technology support</p><h1>Remote computer help without a trip to the repair shop.</h1><p class="lead">Get help with everyday technology, from a slow laptop to confusing email settings. Our planned service is designed for Arizona households, with a real person guiding you through the problem.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/booking/">How to get help</a><a class="plain" href="/#pricing">Compare rates</a></div><p class="note">Service launch in development.</p></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1663524789647-090d8cbd834b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1100&amp;q=82" alt="Woman using a laptop at home" width="1100" height="760" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-photo-rate">$36/hr scheduled · $60/hr on demand<small>Planned launch rates · billed by the minute</small></div></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>What we can help with</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Laptop size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Computers & software</h3><p>Troubleshoot Windows and Mac settings, slow performance, software installation, updates and common error messages.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Mail size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Email & accounts</h3><p>Configure email apps, investigate syncing issues and help you navigate account recovery using official recovery tools.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Printer size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Printers & scanners</h3><p>Work through driver installation, print queues, wireless printer setup and scanning configuration.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Wifi size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Wi-Fi & connectivity</h3><p>Investigate connection problems, router settings and device connectivity when remote access is possible.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Folders size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Photos & files</h3><p>Help organize files, configure cloud storage and understand backup and synchronization options.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><ShieldCheck size={32} strokeWidth={1.75} /></span><h3>Digital safety</h3><p>Review suspicious messages, browser settings and basic account security. Suspected active fraud may require your bank or another specialist.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="block pricing"><div class="wrap"><h2>How remote help works</h2><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Describe the issue</h3><p>Tell us what you are trying to accomplish, what device or software you use and what has gone wrong.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Agree on a plan</h3><p>Confirm the appropriate specialty, rate and scope before starting a session.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Work with a technician</h3><p>Follow guided steps or approve remote access when appropriate, and review the outcome together.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><h3>Do I need to install anything?</h3><p>Depending on the issue, a technician may guide you verbally or ask you to approve a remote support session.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Can you repair broken hardware?</h3><p>Physical damage, failed components and some connectivity issues require local hands-on service.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Will I need to share my password?</h3><p>You should enter passwords yourself. Never send passwords or verification codes to a technician.</p></article></div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/booking/">Explore booking</a><a class="plain" href="/#services">Other services</a></div></div></section></Base>